154	  /**
155	   * Handles the Start Run button click: validates state, calls the API to
156	   * start the orchestrator, then either shows a success banner + status-poll
157	   * timer, or falls back to re-rendering the preflight checklist on failure.
158	   *
159	   * Closure dependencies (from renderOrchestrator() scope):
160	   *   `allChecksPassed`          — guards against starting when preflight has
161	   *                                not passed; mutated to false after a successful
162	   *                                launch so the button cannot be clicked twice.
163	   *   `refreshQueue`             — called immediately after a successful launch
164	   *                                to populate the queue with the new entry;
165	   *                                read-only (function reference).
166	   *   `renderPreflightResults`   — called when the server re-evaluates checks on
167	   *                                a failed start attempt; read-only (function
168	   *                                reference).
169	   *   `_orchStatusPollCleanups`  — the module-level status-poll cleanup registry;
170	   *                                the new setInterval cleanup callback is pushed
171	   *                                here so it is cancelled on full re-render;
172	   *                                mutated.
