327	   *    1. pending  → Kill button   (process is still running)
328	   *    2. dead     → Dismiss button (process has exited without completing)
329	   *    3. projectExists → View Project link (project ledger is on disk)
330	   *  The dead branch precedes the projectExists branch so that a dead entry
331	   *  that also has a known project slug always renders Dismiss, not View Project.
