380	  /** Starts log previews for all currently expanded rows and registers their
381	   *  cleanup callbacks in _orchLogPreviewCleanups.
382	   *
383	   *  Closure dependencies (from renderOrchestrator() scope):
384	   *    `expandedIds`              — read to determine which rows are currently
385	   *                                 expanded; only those rows get a live preview.
386	   *    `_orchLogPreviewCleanups`  — the module-level log-preview cleanup registry;
